# Union-merge the knowledge graph instead of conflicting on it. Two branches
# that each rebuilt graph.json would otherwise produce an unresolvable 11 MB
# JSON conflict.
#
# The driver itself is per-clone git config, NOT carried by this file:
#   git config merge.graphify.name "graphify graph.json union merge"
#   git config merge.graphify.driver "graphify merge-driver %O %A %B"
# Without it git falls back to its built-in merge, so this line is safe in a
# clone that has not run those commands.
graphify-out/graph.json merge=graphify

# Do not attempt a textual diff of the graph — it is generated, and a rewrite
# produces tens of thousands of meaningless changed lines.
graphify-out/graph.json -diff
